      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `Configure-Default-Message` endpoint returns this error if the `messageIdentifier` doesn’t have an `imageState` of `APPROVED`. To determine the current state of a message, see `Get-Message-List`.",
